4. Markets grid: 1024-1279px is one column (Sentiment | AI pair, then indicators, watchlist, live, news).
   At >=1280px it becomes TWO INDEPENDENT COLUMNS (grid 1.7fr / 1fr, right column at least 320px, `align-items:start`):
     Left:  hero, Technical Indicators + Trend, Watchlist (3 across), Live Activity.
     Right: [Sentiment | AI Analyst] side by side, then News directly underneath.
   Each column is its own flex stack, so there is no empty gap between the Sentiment/AI pair and News.
5. Scale-up of content: hero number 48px, hero chart ~208px, watchlist as an auto-fill grid of 3-6 cards (min 152px),
